      "verified_lookup": "Networks implements Deref<Target=HashMap<String, NetworkData>>, so get(&str) borrows the existing map. Cached metadata order, duplicates, first-tick zeros, missing zeros and floating-point division/cast expressions are retained. No persistent state, timers or cadence changes.",
