      "oracle": "All five output fields encoded as ordered length-prefixed UTF-8, little-endian u64 rates and bool; exact bytes and Vec capacities compared across 12 cases and 3 repetitions. Includes first tick, empty data, missing/duplicate/reordered cache entries, maximum counters and zero/negative/NaN/infinite elapsed intervals.",
